Subject: [PATCH 23/28] fix(build): repair red typecheck on main from sprint
 052-c stories
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

MashupDialog.stories.tsx (added in Sprint 052-C) broke `npm run typecheck`
(tsc --build --force, exit 2):
  - imported from `../../types/types` (no such module; Track lives in
    src/types/track.ts)
  - dead MOCK_TRACKS fixture typed as Track[] with an invalid `duration`
    field (Track uses `duration_seconds`) — never referenced anywhere

The dialog fetches tracks internally via useTracks/useSunoMashup, so the
fixture was unused. Removed it and the broken import. typecheck now exits 0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
